  "steps": [
    "Add the filter coffee concoction, salt, honey and ice in a glass and top with low fat milj",
    "Roast Dalia and fry chillies and garlic in a tsp of oil/ghee",
    "Blend them with the coconut, coriander, salt and lemon juice",
    "Top with a tadka and mix!!",
    "Add ghee, rai, jeera, curry leaves and ginger garlic paste on a pan and sauté for 2 mins",
    "Add onion, tomato, beet, carrot and soya granules",
    "Add the masalas and a splash of water and cook for 2-3 mins",
    "Divide the masala into 3-4 parts and add the dosa mix on each portion. Cover and cook for 5-6 mins on low flame",
    "Optionally add ghee and podi masala on top and serve with coconut chutney and iced filter coffee"
  ],
